  "description": "Description:\nBlast into VECTORED, a high-energy arcade shooter inspired by classic shoot ’em ups and rebuilt for modern play.\n\nTake control of a fast, agile drone and dive into a dark, corrupted woodland where shadowy forms and glowing red signals collide. Within a single woodland-style arena, enemy AI units emerge endlessly, pressing in from all directions as the forest reacts to your presence.\n\nThere are no stages to clear and no breaks in the action. As your score climbs, the world pushes back harder, with faster enemies, tighter patterns, and increasing pressure that demands constant movement and sharp reflexes.\n\nLike the arcade legends before it, VECTORED is easy to learn and instantly satisfying. But surviving the escalating chaos requires mastery, awareness, and total control of the airspace.\n\nBuilt for quick pick-up-and-play sessions and endless score-chasing, VECTORED delivers that classic “one more run” feeling, set against a striking dark woodland world lit by red energy and motion.\n\nOld-school roots. Modern reflexes.",
